          "basis": "Mary's benchmark aluminium estimate (BSW register medians) against the pricing document Fenster ISSUED to SM5 Developments on 29/07/2026 12:22, FAO Ryan Steadman - GBP 20,563.57 ex VAT, built off BSW Sheerline QT253300 with Bellview 0000000475 doors at 15%. History of this entry: logged 24/07 as issued, corrected 28/07 to 'priced but never sent' when Adam said so, and now genuinely issued - verified against the sent attachment, which differs from the 24/07 version by exactly one cell, the date. So this is at last a clean benchmark-vs-issued point.",
          "lesson": "Live Sheerline Prestige runs ~10% above register alu medians, and this benchmark predated the system-depth coupling correction, so the gap on a correctly-built job would be wider than -9.5%. NOTE THE ISSUED FIGURE IS ITSELF SHORT: BSW added GBP 143.01 of restrictors 41 minutes before the send and it never reached the document, so the sell rests on a supply cost we no longer have. When you compare against an issued number, check the supplier quote behind it is still the current one.",
