        "why_now": "Pride Developments has eleven quotes open, a twelfth being priced right now (Redditch Library) and a GBP 321,833 package quoted on 26 June that has never been followed up. They are one of the few clients here who are actively still sending us work, which makes the silence on the older ones worth a single call rather than a series of chases.",
