        "body": "Roddy,\n\nWe priced the B239 windows package for you at the end of June and I have not heard where it went. Is that one still live?\n\nWhile I have you - we have a number of packages open with Pride going back to last autumn, including two rounds on St Catherines House in Plymouth and the Exmoor Drive and Brandon Youth schemes. I suspect some of those are long since decided. If you can tell me which are dead I will take them off our list, and we can concentrate on the ones that are not.\n\nYour Redditch Library enquiry is with our estimators now.\n\n",
        "evidence": "AdminBase: eleven Pride rows 'Live - Quoted', B239 Windows PD7851 quoted 26/06/2026 with a 10/07 follow-up never actioned; St Catherines House priced twice, 28/11/2025 and 18/12/2025. Redditch Library priced 28/07/2026, not yet issued - held by Mary.",
