        "why_now": "THE CALLBACK IS OURS AND IT RUNS OUT TOMORROW. Kieran Santry told Paul Taylor on 05/06/2026 that Alexander James are PREFERRED BIDDER on Tiverton Road and to come back in 6-8 weeks; Paul answered 'Perfect, I'll be in touch then.' Six to eight weeks from 05/06 is 17/07 to 31/07/2026. GBP 547,886 ex VAT, the largest unworked row on this board, and the only thing between it and a live conversation is the promise being kept on time.",
        "job": "Tiverton Road - 17 flats, windows and doors package (AdminBase lead 7388)",
